{"schema":"runtime-bank-content@1","chunk_id":"achievement_math-01","kind":"keys","items":[{"key":"am-001","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oe5852a","text":"{5, 2}"},{"id":"o5eb7b0","text":"{5, −2}"},{"id":"oe7b3a1","text":"{−5, 2}"},{"id":"o35405a","text":"{5}"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o5eb7b0"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"للقيمة المطلقة حالتان: 2x − 3 = 7 ومنها x = 5، أو 2x − 3 = −7 ومنها 2x = −4، أي x = −2؛ فمجموعة الحل {5, −2}.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-002","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o972e0a","text":"1"},{"id":"ofdec49","text":"i"},{"id":"oae8535","text":"−1"},{"id":"o6e7a55","text":"−i"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o6e7a55"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"قوى i تتكرر كل أربع قوى، وباقي قسمة 23 على 4 يساوي 3؛ لذا i²³ = i³ = i² × i = −i.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-003","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o10632a","text":"3"},{"id":"o81d962","text":"6"},{"id":"o4eabbd","text":"9"},{"id":"oa24951","text":"36"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o81d962"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"يكون للمعادلة جذران متساويان عندما يساوي المميز صفرًا: k² − 4 × 1 × 9 = 0، أي k² = 36، ومنه k = ±6، والقيمة الموجبة 6.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-004","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"ob4b082","text":"5"},{"id":"od53359","text":"7"},{"id":"o0c2ead","text":"3"},{"id":"oc86b56","text":"−11"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o0c2ead"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"حسب نظرية الباقي، الباقي يساوي p(2) = 8 − 8 + 2k + 4 = 2k + 4، وبمساواته بالعدد 10 نجد 2k = 6، أي k = 3.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-005","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1039c1","text":"9"},{"id":"oa599d3","text":"7"},{"id":"o16e9f3","text":"35"},{"id":"oba7264","text":"8"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oba7264"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"من العلاقة بين الجذور والمعاملات: α + β = 6/2 = 3، وαβ = 1/2. ولأن α² + β² = (α + β)² − 2αβ، فإن α² + β² = 9 − 1 = 8.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-006","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"od1f76b","text":"−11"},{"id":"o7ab308","text":"−7"},{"id":"oc98bc1","text":"5"},{"id":"odfd32a","text":"13"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oc98bc1"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"بالتعويض: f(−2) = 2(−2)² − 3 = 2 × 4 − 3 = 5، مع الانتباه إلى أن (−2)² = 4 عدد موجب.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-007","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o183a35","text":"x > 4"},{"id":"o5b1ead","text":"x ≤ 4"},{"id":"o286651","text":"x ≥ −4"},{"id":"off5bb4","text":"x ≥ 4"}],"answer":{"option_id":"off5bb4"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"لا يُعرَّف الجذر التربيعي في الأعداد الحقيقية إلا لمقدار غير سالب، لذا x − 4 ≥ 0، أي x ≥ 4. ويدخل العدد 4 في المجال لأن √0 = 0.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-008","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o9072fa","text":"{−3, 3}"},{"id":"oba9970","text":"{4}"},{"id":"o64a9bd","text":"{3}"},{"id":"o5677d1","text":"{9}"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o64a9bd"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"بخاصية الضرب للوغاريتمات: log₂((x − 1)(x + 1)) = 3، أي x² − 1 = 2³ = 8، ومنه x = ±3، ولأن تعريف اللوغاريتمين يشترط x − 1 > 0 وx + 1 > 0 (أي x > 1) نستبعد −3، فمجموعة الحل {3}، وللتحقق: log₂ 2 + log₂ 4 = 1 + 2 = 3. أما {4} فتنتج من الخطأ الشائع بجمع ما داخل اللوغاريتمين (2x = 8).","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-009","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o778e58","text":"7"},{"id":"oe09545","text":"9"},{"id":"od4f4ee","text":"20"},{"id":"o8df618","text":"25"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o778e58"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"(f ∘ g)(2) = f(g(2))، فنحسب أولًا g(2) = 4، ثم f(4) = 4 + 3 = 7. أما 25 فهو ناتج (g ∘ f)(2) بعكس ترتيب التركيب.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-010","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"odc1ef7","text":"2x − 1"},{"id":"o1cce82","text":"(x + 1)/2"},{"id":"oc5db6b","text":"2/(x − 1)"},{"id":"o14ed1f","text":"2x + 1"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o14ed1f"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"نكتب y = (x − 1)/2 ونبدّل بين x وy: x = (y − 1)/2، ومنه y − 1 = 2x، أي y = 2x + 1؛ إذن f⁻¹(x) = 2x + 1.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-011","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o32bb9f","text":"{0, 1}"},{"id":"o17b2ab","text":"{1, 3}"},{"id":"o9cd9a7","text":"{1}"},{"id":"oc66e22","text":"{0, 3}"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o32bb9f"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"بما أن 9ˣ = (3ˣ)²، نضع y = 3ˣ فتصبح المعادلة y² − 4y + 3 = 0، أي (y − 1)(y − 3) = 0، ومنه y = 1 أو y = 3. إذن 3ˣ = 1 تعطي x = 0، و3ˣ = 3 تعطي x = 1.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-012","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oaf1950","text":"1/2"},{"id":"o3c7843","text":"√2/2"},{"id":"o1b3319","text":"√3/2"},{"id":"o611691","text":"√3"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oaf1950"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"في المثلث الثلاثيني الستيني يكون طول الضلع المقابل للزاوية 30° نصف طول الوتر، لذا sin 30° = المقابل ÷ الوتر = 1/2. أما √3/2 فهي قيمة cos 30°.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-013","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o55bebc","text":"5π/3"},{"id":"oe4ce3d","text":"3π/4"},{"id":"o3bf26e","text":"6π/5"},{"id":"od929a2","text":"5π/6"}],"answer":{"option_id":"od929a2"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"للتحويل من الدرجات إلى الراديان نضرب في π/180: 150 × π/180 = 5π/6.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-014","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oa29b7e","text":"−4/5"},{"id":"o2bfbad","text":"4/5"},{"id":"o7af236","text":"−3/4"},{"id":"o8260a3","text":"3/4"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oa29b7e"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"من المتطابقة sin²θ + cos²θ = 1: cos²θ = 1 − 9/25 = 16/25، ومنه cos θ = ±4/5. ولأن جيب التمام سالب في الربع الثاني، فإن cos θ = −4/5.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-016","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oa78833","text":"{2π/3, 4π/3}"},{"id":"o1e6aa1","text":"{0, 2π/3, 4π/3}"},{"id":"o949610","text":"{0, π/3, 5π/3}"},{"id":"odb5705","text":"{π/3, π, 5π/3}"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o1e6aa1"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"بالتحليل: (2cos x + 1)(cos x − 1) = 0، فإما cos x = 1 ومنه x = 0، وإما cos x = −1/2 ومنه x = 2π/3 أو x = 4π/3؛ فمجموعة الحل {0, 2π/3, 4π/3}.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-017","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o484cea","text":"2"},{"id":"o0e14cb","text":"−2"},{"id":"od92b3f","text":"1/2"},{"id":"obb25fc","text":"−1/2"}],"answer":{"option_id":"obb25fc"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"ميل المستقيم المعطى 2، وحاصل ضرب ميلي مستقيمين متعامدين يساوي −1، لذا الميل المطلوب = −1 ÷ 2 = −1/2.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-018","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"od24c18","text":"8"},{"id":"o9b1a45","text":"9"},{"id":"o08c0b3","text":"10"},{"id":"o621bfe","text":"12"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o9b1a45"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"قياس كل زاوية خارجية = 180° − 140° = 40°، ولأن المضلع المنتظم محدب فمجموع قياسات زواياه الخارجية (زاوية عند كل رأس) 360°، إذن عدد الأضلاع = 360° ÷ 40° = 9. وللتحقق: (9 − 2) × 180° ÷ 9 = 1260° ÷ 9 = 140°.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-019","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o3fb73a","text":"المركز (3, −2) ونصف القطر 4"},{"id":"obed949","text":"المركز (−3, 2) ونصف القطر 4"},{"id":"o6fc37e","text":"المركز (3, −2) ونصف القطر 16"},{"id":"oeae6c8","text":"المركز (−3, 2) ونصف القطر √3"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o3fb73a"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"بإكمال المربع: (x² − 6x + 9) + (y² + 4y + 4) = 3 + 9 + 4، أي (x − 3)² + (y + 2)² = 16؛ فالمركز (3, −2) ونصف القطر √16 = 4.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-020","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oaf38b8","text":"2 سم"},{"id":"o6bacfa","text":"6 سم"},{"id":"ob1bc76","text":"8 سم"},{"id":"o47c445","text":"2√41 سم"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o6bacfa"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"العمود النازل من المركز على الوتر ينصّفه، فينشأ مثلث قائم وتره نصف القطر 10 وأحد ضلعيه نصف الوتر 8؛ لذا البعد = √(10² − 8²) = √36 = 6 سم.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-021","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"ob41817","text":"12π سم³"},{"id":"o1cb3a5","text":"15π سم³"},{"id":"odb272c","text":"36π سم³"},{"id":"o44b906","text":"45π سم³"}],"answer":{"option_id":"ob41817"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"المساحة الجانبية = πrℓ، فـ 3πℓ = 15π ومنه الارتفاع الجانبي ℓ = 5 سم، ثم الارتفاع h = √(5² − 3²) = 4 سم. الحجم = (1/3)πr²h = (1/3)π × 9 × 4 = 12π سم³.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-022","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"odc2a5d","text":"0"},{"id":"o5bd7ff","text":"2"},{"id":"o4c7846","text":"4"},{"id":"o6f1b4d","text":"غير موجودة"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o4c7846"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"التعويض المباشر يعطي الصيغة 0/0، فنحلل البسط: (x − 2)(x + 2)/(x − 2) = x + 2 عندما x ≠ 2، ومنه النهاية = 2 + 2 = 4.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-023","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oa091c9","text":"12x³ − 5"},{"id":"o2e3d63","text":"12x³ − 5x"},{"id":"o11397b","text":"3x³ − 5"},{"id":"o72e5c2","text":"12x⁴ − 5"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oa091c9"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"بقاعدة مشتقة القوة: مشتقة 3x⁴ هي 4 × 3x³ = 12x³، ومشتقة −5x هي −5، ومشتقة الثابت 2 صفر؛ إذن f′(x) = 12x³ − 5.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-024","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o581346","text":"4"},{"id":"o89bbe8","text":"12"},{"id":"of2f27f","text":"14"},{"id":"oa396f1","text":"10"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oa396f1"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"ميل المماس يساوي قيمة المشتقة عند النقطة: y′ = 3x² − 2، وعند x = 2 يكون الميل 3 × 4 − 2 = 10. أما 4 فهي قيمة y نفسها عند x = 2 وليست الميل.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-025","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oa35208","text":"−2"},{"id":"o765ae4","text":"0"},{"id":"od14831","text":"2"},{"id":"o85edc5","text":"4"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o765ae4"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"بقاعدة مشتقة الضرب: f′(x) = 2x(x − 2) + (x² + 1) × 1، وعند x = 1: f′(1) = 2 × (−1) + 2 = 0. وللتحقق بالفك: f(x) = x³ − 2x² + x − 2، فـ f′(x) = 3x² − 4x + 1 وf′(1) = 0.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-026","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o54bb72","text":"8"},{"id":"o82de34","text":"10"},{"id":"o912591","text":"13"},{"id":"o892a71","text":"26"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o82de34"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"الدالة الأصلية للمقدار 3x² + 1 هي x³ + x، وبالتعويض بين الحدين: (2³ + 2) − (0 + 0) = 10.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-027","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"oa8cef0","text":"x = −3"},{"id":"o71016c","text":"x = −1"},{"id":"o0df37f","text":"x = 1"},{"id":"o6bab9a","text":"x = 3"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o71016c"},"fixed_order_reason":null},"explanation":{"text":"f′(x) = 3x² − 6x − 9 = 3(x − 3)(x + 1)، فالنقطتان الحرجتان x = −1 وx = 3. تتغير إشارة f′ من موجبة إلى سالبة عند x = −1 فتكون عندها قيمة عظمى محلية، أما عند x = 3 فتتغير من سالبة إلى موجبة فتكون صغرى محلية.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-028","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o736978","text":"1/6"},{"id":"o368ada","text":"1/11"},{"id":"o7a708d","text":"1/12"},{"id":"o881389","text":"7/36"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o736978"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"عدد النواتج الممكنة 6 × 6 = 36، والنواتج التي مجموعها 7 ستة: (1, 6)، (2, 5)، (3, 4)، (4, 3)، (5, 2)، (6, 1)؛ فالاحتمال 6/36 = 1/6.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-029","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"od2417b","text":"21"},{"id":"o96c9a9","text":"210"},{"id":"o37f71c","text":"343"},{"id":"oeaea96","text":"35"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oeaea96"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"الترتيب غير مهم في اللجنة، فنستخدم التوافيق: ₇C₃ = 7!/(3! × 4!) = (7 × 6 × 5)/(3 × 2 × 1) = 35. أما 210 فهي عدد التباديل ₇P₃ التي تراعي الترتيب.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-030","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o3fc1c2","text":"0.2"},{"id":"o7fe0a0","text":"0.7"},{"id":"ob686ee","text":"0.8"},{"id":"o98dbc6","text":"0.9"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o7fe0a0"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"لأن الحادثتين مستقلتان: P(A ∩ B) = 0.4 × 0.5 = 0.2، ومن قاعدة الجمع: P(A ∪ B) = 0.4 + 0.5 − 0.2 = 0.7.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-031","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"ofce471","text":"47.5%"},{"id":"o89608e","text":"68%"},{"id":"o0e7551","text":"95%"},{"id":"oe30a42","text":"99.7%"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o0e7551"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"الدرجتان 60 و80 تبعدان عن المتوسط انحرافين معياريين (70 ± 2 × 5)، وحسب القاعدة التجريبية تقع نحو 95% من البيانات ضمن انحرافين معياريين من المتوسط.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-032","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o4b13a9","text":"4/15"},{"id":"o3d33e1","text":"7/15"},{"id":"ob2fc90","text":"12/25"},{"id":"o563132","text":"8/15"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o563132"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"للحصول على لونين مختلفين حالتان: أحمر ثم أزرق واحتماله (4/10) × (6/9) = 4/15، أو أزرق ثم أحمر واحتماله (6/10) × (4/9) = 4/15؛ فالاحتمال الكلي 4/15 + 4/15 = 8/15.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-033","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o2c414f","text":"59"},{"id":"o7e25fa","text":"60"},{"id":"ob7bad5","text":"62"},{"id":"o6cc33f","text":"65"}],"answer":{"option_id":"ob7bad5"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"الحد النوني للمتتابعة الحسابية aₙ = a₁ + (n − 1)d، إذن a₂₀ = 5 + 19 × 3 = 5 + 57 = 62.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-034","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"ob6e448","text":"48"},{"id":"o9f9c08","text":"192"},{"id":"oe4ea11","text":"384"},{"id":"o73ffde","text":"768"}],"answer":{"option_id":"oe4ea11"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"أساس المتتابعة r = 6 ÷ 3 = 2، والحد النوني aₙ = a₁ × rⁿ⁻¹، إذن a₈ = 3 × 2⁷ = 3 × 128 = 384.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-035","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o0199aa","text":"779"},{"id":"o7ba37a","text":"820"},{"id":"od2a6ed","text":"861"},{"id":"o9c6115","text":"1640"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o7ba37a"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"الأساس 4، وعدد الحدود n = (79 − 3)/4 + 1 = 20. المجموع Sₙ = n(a₁ + aₙ)/2 = 20 × (3 + 79)/2 = 20 × 41 = 820.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-036","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o57a8c2","text":"93"},{"id":"o5fbe4f","text":"96"},{"id":"o670650","text":"186"},{"id":"o8a97b0","text":"189"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o57a8c2"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"a₆ ÷ a₃ = r³ = 96 ÷ 12 = 8، فالأساس r = 2، والحد الأول a₁ = 12 ÷ 2² = 3. إذن S₅ = a₁(r⁵ − 1)/(r − 1) = 3 × (32 − 1)/1 = 93.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-037","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o339494","text":"−10"},{"id":"o5266b8","text":"7"},{"id":"o3c1bcb","text":"10"},{"id":"o71c5de","text":"14"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o3c1bcb"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"محدد المصفوفة من الرتبة 2 × 2 يساوي حاصل ضرب عنصري القطر الرئيس مطروحًا منه حاصل ضرب عنصري القطر الآخر: det(A) = 3 × 4 − 2 × 1 = 12 − 2 = 10.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-038","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o15b35a","text":"0"},{"id":"ob31b0e","text":"1"},{"id":"of6ffef","text":"2"},{"id":"o2b9e6b","text":"3"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o2b9e6b"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"العنصر في الصف الثاني والعمود الأول من AB يساوي ناتج ضرب الصف الثاني من A في العمود الأول من B: (0 × 2) + (3 × 1) = 3. أما 1 فهو العنصر المقابل في BA، لأن ضرب المصفوفات ليس إبداليًا.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-039","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o7de9ec","text":"−2"},{"id":"o24c052","text":"9/2"},{"id":"o4c3089","text":"2"},{"id":"o8069fc","text":"8"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o4c3089"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"لا يكون للمصفوفة نظير ضربي إذا كان محددها صفرًا: 6k − 4 × 3 = 0، أي 6k = 12، ومنه k = 2. أما 9/2 فتنتج من الخطأ الشائع بضرب عنصري كل صف بدلًا من عنصري كل قطر (4k = 3 × 6).","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null},{"key":"am-040","revision":1,"payload":{"options":[{"id":"o69aa4a","text":"8"},{"id":"of87111","text":"15"},{"id":"o2a149f","text":"45"},{"id":"o3761ce","text":"135"}],"answer":{"option_id":"o2a149f"},"fixed_order_reason":"numeric_ascending"},"explanation":{"text":"ضرب المصفوفة في العدد 3 يضرب كلًّا من صفيها في 3، فيُضرب المحدد في 3 مرتين، أي det(3A) = 3² × det(A) = 9 × 5 = 45.","steps":[]},"objective":null,"source":null}]}
